{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101807","id":2286319659,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6IRngr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101807","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101807.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101807.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101807","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101807/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101807/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101807/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ae0b7ff42ded286e3bc3c1159373419d0537fb9d","number":101807,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Embedded Game Size","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #100883\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes multiple issues related to the game window size when embedding is enabled.\r\n\r\nThe main challenge was to find a way to support a mode where the game size stretches to fit the Game Workspace when developing games where the window size is not crucial, while also supporting a fixed size when it is important.\r\n\r\nThe solution I suggest is to add a new fixed-size mode. In this mode, even if the Game Workspace is larger, the window size defined in the project settings will be used. This mode is now the default.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the Floating Window did not respect the project and editor settings for window size and placement. This PR modifies the Floating Window to have an initial size that accounts for the controls and margins of the Game Workspace. As a result, upon starting, the Game Window should always align with the project/editor settings. A side effect of this modification is that the position and size of the Floating Window will be reset with each run.\r\n\r\nI was unsure what to do with minimized, maximized, and fullscreen modes. For now, embedding is not disabled when these modes are enabled. The game will start as usual.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8740dfe-6dc8-42a2-bf37-8a2d1a2f6bf8)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a67db26-cfb4-4b57-b08f-b321a2b2a2d4)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d42dbbe-3e0f-4b5f-ba4d-bad0343fcd48)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/726a84f7-cdee-47d9-9774-79dd19681f93)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2728156a-6e59-4d8e-a9f4-c3a04df37db8)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":